{"id":33246,"slug":"wall-e","title":"WALL·E","year":2008,"country":"United States","duration":98,"spine":1161,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/33246-wall-e","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/0d4a92b3c7f846f4ab4b202fd3fc6973/mje5UAVt8hzxxB3sY11YZ53LfXNcxo_large.jpg","description":"A high-water mark of digital animation, this prescient vision of a dystopian future is packaged within a dazzling pop-science-fiction love story, making for an urgent fable for our troubled millennium. It’s the twenty-ninth century, and humans have long since fled Earth for outer space, leaving WALL•E, the last functioning trash-compacting robot, to go about the work of cleaning up a pollution-choked planet, one piece of garbage at a time. When he meets EVE, a fellow automaton sent to detect plant life, the pair are launched on an intergalactic quest to return humanity to Earth. Transporting us simultaneously back to cinema’s silent origins and light-years into the future, WALL•E is a soaring ode to the power of love and art to heal a dying world.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Andrew Stanton","slug":"andrew-stanton"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Ben Burtt","role":"WALL•E/M-O","slug":"ben-burtt"},{"actor":"Elissa Knight","role":"EVE","slug":"elissa-knight"},{"actor":"Jeff Garlin","role":"Captain","slug":"jeff-garlin"},{"actor":"Fred Willard","role":"Shelby Forthright","slug":"fred-willard"},{"actor":"MacInTalk","role":"Auto","slug":"macintalk"},{"actor":"John Ratzenberger","role":"John","slug":"john-ratzenberger"},{"actor":"Kathy Najimy","role":"Mary","slug":"kathy-najimy"},{"actor":"Sigourney Weaver","role":"Ship’s computer","slug":"sigourney-weaver"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Andrew Stanton","slug":"andrew-stanton"},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Jim Morris","slug":null},{"role":"Coproduced by","person":"Lindsey Collins","slug":null},{"role":"Executive producer","person":"John Lasseter","slug":null},{"role":"Associate producer","person